  "_readme": "Edit decision list for the 30 s ad. Times are output seconds. 'src' files live in ../captures/. 'srcIn' is the source start in seconds (a negative value counts back from the end of the clip). 'speed' 'auto' fits the whole clip into the slot; any speed above 1.5 gets an on-screen 'sped up' label with the real factor. 'crop' is [x, y, w, h] in source pixels (null = full frame). 'box' is the output card [x, y, w, h]. Footage is scaled to fit inside the box without changing its aspect ratio. Callout 'at' is [x, y] in OUTPUT pixels; 'r' is the ring radius. Tune crop and callouts after dropping in real captures.",
